alternatives: Removing the pockets prevents the jaw seating over the existing keys. Angling the roofs changes their rectangular clearance and requires a matching carrier. Reversing the print pose puts the liner and tube-contact geometry down. Automatic support retains the matching key seats in the pocket-up pose.
